      "id": "2066621765028327922",
      "author": "DataChaz",
      "text": "How do you index the entire Linux kernel (28M lines of code) for an AI agent in 3 minutes?\n\nYou stop letting the agent read files one by one.\n\nThere is a fascinating new open-source release called codebase-memory-mcp.\n\nIt's a code intelligence engine that swaps traditional",
      "url": "https://xcancel.com/DataChaz/status/2066621765028327922",
      "likes": 591,
      "replies": 33,
